// Every call in the function passes through here as the walk reaches it,
// whether or not its own statement has anything to fix -- an earlier one
// that writes must still clear the cache (out/emit/name/pick/reuse/) before
// a later statement reads it. fix_names calls this again per event during
// naming, since two reads of one call and a write between them can all sit
// in the one statement, after the whole statement has already been walked.
fix_rcache_taint(int e) {
  if(k_of(e) == "call" && fix_call_touch(e) == 1) {
    fix_rcache_reset();
  }
} return void;
